  "Metadata": {
    "$id": "178",
    "Name": "PWR native Gaea watershed v5",
    "Description": "Author PWR's native Gaea landforms; build via the licensed Gaea UI.\n\nNo image luminance is used as elevation. Broad Alpine mountain primitives and\nlower foothills feed two hydraulic erosion passes. Roads and sites are applied\nlater against the frozen gameplay contract, not baked into the geomorphology.",
